{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "このだいかんせいが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きみのみかただ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さあわれらといこう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いしづかたまき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__104521740_0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きみ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのユニフォーごにょごにょ..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きをとりなおして"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほんじつは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いしづかたまき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ばーすでーい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せっかくなので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "た・ま・き"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "できょうはポカが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いしづかをとくべつに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜんりょくで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おうえんしてあげる〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "せーの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなた〜ざかの〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなたざかの〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "は〜た〜の〜も〜と〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっしづか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「た」　たましいたぎらせ　あこがれのステージで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「ま」　まもりせめすすめよ　さあチームをえがおに"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「き」　きめろいしづか　かんせいをあびながら"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れっつふぁい　たまき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れっつちゃーじ　たまき"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "にじのあーちをかけろ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かがやくひかりあびて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それゆけいしづか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆめをかなえよう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__104521738_0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "では"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タレコミもいきます〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・食に興味がなさすぎて韓国に行ってもテキトーに買って食べるらしいです！コーラばっかだし偏食で心配！（by こにし）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "食よりもきゃっぷしゃっふる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でぃすいずたまきいしづか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・コーヒーを頼んだ時に甘さが足りず私が飲めずにいると、お菓子を頼んだついでにシロップをもらってきてくれました！（by ヨーコ）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やさい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やさいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（やさしい　やさしいな〜　ていういみです）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__104521739_0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・裏でもネコキャラ全開🐱！徹底されています（by じゃーまね）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きゃらづくりしてるみたいにいうじゃん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なちゅらるぼーんねこ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でぃすいずたまきいしづか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・いつもニャンニャンしてるけど、レッスン中は真剣でパフォーマンスとのギャップがかっこいいです（by じゃーまね）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "にゃんころたまきと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わんころヨーコ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ここは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ひなたどうぶつえん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/S__104570886.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなわけで"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あつい夏に"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あついいしづかの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ばーすでーを"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おいわいしました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あらためて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おめでとう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポカ"}], "source": "official"}